        "effect": "Re-creates the covenant at output 0 with the token's whole amount, the same ASSET, TOKEN, CAP and MINTED, and the operator and cold keys the spender names, with no issuance on input 0. It replaces a lost or stolen key; it cannot release the token or raise the cap. Signed by COLD_KEY over the whole transaction.",
